                      Essential Graphics Chart for Windows 1.0
                      ========================================

Welcome to the Chart for Windows demo version 1.0.  Included on this disk are 
a number of files needed for the demo.  The SETUP.EXE program should be
used to install the software.  The necessary files will be decompressed and 
copied to the directory of your choice.

Upon installation a number of files will be copied.

EGWDEMO.EXE	Demo program.

EGWCOLMN.DLL	DLLs needed to create and display the charts.
EGWPIE.DLL	
EGWPYRMD.DLL	

EGCWCASE.EXE	Contains the Chart Development Tool for prototyping and
PIECASE.DLL     developing chart templates. Also contains the DLLs needed
PYRCASE.DLL     for using EGCWCASE.  Please read the file EGCWCASE.DOC for
COLCASE.DLL     more information.
           

All DLLs should be copied to the Windows\System directory.

EGCWCASE Updates
================
EGCWCASE requires the DLLs COLCASE.DLL, PYRCASE.DLL, and PIECASE.DLL to run.
These DLLs should be copied to the Windows\System directory or any other 
directory contained in your PATH statement.
